{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QR Code Generator</strong> \u2013 A simple yet powerful desktop app for creating, saving, and copying QR codes. It works offline, keeping your data secure and generation fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need more customization? <strong>QR Code Generator Plus</strong> unlocks advanced design features for professional results:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Choose QR code &amp; background colors<br>\u2714 Transparent background for seamless designs<br>\u2714 4 unique pattern styles<br>\u2714 Add your logo to the center<br>\u2714 Adjust size without quality loss</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Professional Export Formats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG, EPS</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intuitive Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Real-time preview<br>\u2714 One-click copy to clipboard<br>\u2714 Flexible resizing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn basic codes into branded assets with <strong>QR Code Generator Plus</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643300?t=1747438407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643300/3408db87d99eb940c853e3539570ffa843384ee3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747438407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643300/22b49400a3835917ba48eb557595e7b6f092efc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747438407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643300/22b49400a3835917ba48eb557595e7b6f092efc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747438407","categories":[{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QR Code Generator</strong> \u2013 A simple yet powerful desktop app for creating, saving, and copying QR codes. It works offline, keeping your data secure and generat